@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@
+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing support currently classifies questions through
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`:
+
+- A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as
+  `refund-review`.
+- Every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The implementation only establishes routing. A `refund-review` classification
+does not approve or issue a refund, and an `invoice-question` classification
+does not change an invoice or confirm that any billing action occurred.

